# Fluxion .cargoignore - Aggressive exclusion to meet 10MB limit

# === Large Data (not needed for crate) ===
refdata/
data/
models/
assets/

# === Test & Benchmark files ===
tests/
benches/
test_case_900_fix.sh

# === Documentation (available on GitHub) ===
docs/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE

# === Large config files ===
delta_config.yaml
dhat-heap.json
sensitivity_report.*

# === Docker & CI ===
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.githooks/
.github/

# === Session/IDE files ===
session_*.md
*.swp
*~

# === Planning files ===
.planning/

# === Build outputs ===
target/
Cargo.lock

# === Examples (can be separate crate) ===
examples/
tools/
api/

# === Config files ===
config/
audit.toml
codecov.yml
.editorconfig
.env*
.dockerignore